      "date": "2026-02-06T12:12:00.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.06 (vs ₹11.16 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.06 (down from ₹11.16 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹9.88b (down 40% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹108.8m (down 64% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.1% (down from 1.8% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 12% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 5% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
