      "date": "2026-01-07T12:51:00.000Z",
      "title": "Veritas (India) Limited Regularizes Appointment of Sunil Sehgal as Non-Executive Non-Independent Director, Effective January 5, 2026",
      "body": "Veritas (India) Limited announced that the Members vide its Postal Ballot Resolution dated January 05, 2026 regularized the appointment of Mr. Sehgal as Non-Executive, Non-Independent Director liable to retire by rotation. The results of the Postal were declared on January 07, 2026 and the resolution is deemed to be passed on last date specified for the e-voting i.e. January 05, 2026. Mr. Sunil Sehgal, a Commerce graduate, has 36 years in depth Corporate experience and exposure, especially in varied industries like textile, engineering, chemical, pharmaceutical, and allied sectors. With his diverse industry experience and strong entrepreneurial approach, Mr. Sehgal brings valuable commercial and operational insights to the Board. His induction to the Board will be immensely useful to the c",
